### 7 cli render broken.x.md --format text
$ xmd render broken.x.md --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 1
--- stdout
[unrelated] := solve(3 >= 2)
[loose] := solve(loose + missing >= 2)
[a] := b
[b] := a
[cyclic] := solve(a >= 1)
